// Fertilizer-schedule reference data, built ONLY from the two ICAR advisory PDFs supplied for this project:
//   1. ICAR Kharif Agro-Advisories for Farmers 2025  (state-wise, Kharif season)
//   2. ICAR Rabi Agro-Advisory for Farmers 2021-22   (zone/state-wise, Rabi season)
// Generated by a build script that checks every "anchor" sentence against the PDF text and records the PDF page it was found on.
// RULES for editing this file (same as seedRates.js):
//  - Add a plan only if you can point to the exact document and page it came from. Never fill in a dose or a day from memory.
//  - pages = page numbers counted in the PDF file (cover = page 1), not the number printed on the page.
//  - Doses are per HECTARE. "basis: nutrient" doses are kg of N, P2O5, K2O, S per hectare (the calculator turns them into urea, DAP/SSP, MOP).
//    "basis: product" doses are kg of the named fertilizer per hectare, exactly as the advisory names it (urea, DAP, SSP, MOP, ZnSO4, gypsum).
//  - A value written as [low, high] is a range printed in the advisory.
//  - day = {from, to} in days after the plan's base date (sowing, transplanting, planting or emergence). Steps with no day are stage-based only.
//  - SEASONAL, STATE-LEVEL advisories, not national norms. Rabi 2021-22 is an older document: confirm locally.

